{
  "_doc": "Quaternius 'Ultimate Monsters' Enemy rig (Root/Body/Head/Arm/Arm_end/Leg/Leg_end; e.g. Giant) -> ToEE Bip01 biped (tested: Troll; also matches the hill giant rig). Arms/legs are one source bone each, so their weights are split over the ToEE limb bones by distance.",
